{
  "name": "factory-opus-luna",
  "description": "Claude Opus 5.5 (medium) is the lead engineer: it writes the spec and design for every new program, plans very large requests, and advises or takes over when the workers are stuck. GPT-6 Luna through Codex does the building (low effort first, high when stuck) and the reviewing. The expert reasons; the workers type.",
